        {
            "presentation_step_number": "1",
            "title": "Solara: Goal-Driven Actions",
            "narration_statement": "We introduced Solara Energy and looked at how agents can take a goal like monitoring site performance and turn it into a sequence of real actions, querying data, comparing outputs, flagging anomalies and generating reports.",
